{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:0.2"], "en": "The Book of the Twos,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:0.3"], "en": "Chapter on Intimacy (Santhavavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:0.4"], "en": "1. The Indasamānagotta Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:1.1", "PA_ja_161:1.2"], "en": "\"One should not form intimacy with a base person, for the Noble One understands the welfare of one who is ignoble.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:1.3"], "en": "Even after long residence [in the world], one commits evil,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:1.4"], "en": "just as the elephant did to him of the same clan as Indra.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:2.1"], "en": "But one should know only him who thinks, \"He is my equal.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:2.2"], "en": "\"By virtue, wisdom, and learning as well—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:2.3"], "en": "one should form friendship with such a person;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:2.4"], "en": "for indeed, association with a true person is blissful.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_161:3.1"], "en": "The Indasamānagotta Jātaka is the first.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
